// Miss: a thin pulse falling away with a short metallic tick.
// Composed in MML for the TerraForma example game; rendered with chipsynth (python -m chipsynth sfx).
title Miss
author Claude, at Michael Allen Wilmes's request
tempo 240
once

[instr]
whiff wave=pulse pw=12 a=0 d=6 s=4 r=3 vol=11
tick  wave=noise nmode=short a=0 d=2 s=0 r=1 vol=9

V1: @whiff o5 g32 slide 16 4e16
V2: @tick o6 c32 r16
